  "_about": "Combined federal + Ontario personal income tax brackets, versioned by calendar year. Consumed by tax_engine.py. Years not present fall back to the NEAREST available year. Source: taxtips.ca prior-year tax-rate pages (federal + Ontario), compiled 2026-06. Federal rates are STATUTORY marginal rates (e.g. 0.29, not taxtips' BPA-phaseout-adjusted 29.3%); fed_bpa is the maximum (enhanced) basic personal amount, applied as a flat 15% credit (the high-income BPA phase-out is not modelled). Ontario surtax thresholds were cross-checked for monotonic year-over-year indexation (T2 > T1 every year). cg_inclusion = 0.50 throughout (the 2024 proposed 2/3 inclusion never took effect). Populated 2015-2025: this spans the full walk-forward (2015-2026) and every materially-taxed exit in the full-history backtest; pre-2015 portfolios are tiny so they fall back to 2015 with negligible effect. 'inf' = top-bracket upper bound; brackets are [upper_bound, marginal_rate].",
